mapping "X4582.1" source="X4582" target="216633005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X4582 = SNOMED CT 216633005 (Swedish national extension). Base X45 Athena-crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 441465 (concept_code 216633005) via ICD10 relationship 45756401 -> 441465. The Swedish
        extension subdivides the base event by a place/activity/qualifier axis with no distinct standard
        SNOMED CT clinical analogue; the underlying clinical event is unchanged. Target subsumes the source
        event -> broader. Confidence : verified Athena crosswalk on base X45, one-level broader (Swedish
        qualifier dropped).
        """
}
